OL,3,GNEWSAAlgorithm allocates Highland
OL,4,A'significant increase' in
OL,5,Aasylum-seeking children
OL,6,
OL,7,FHighland Council says a Home Office
OL,8,Falgorithm has allocated it with a
OL,9,F"significant increase" in unaccompanied
OL,10,Fasylum-seeking children to look after.
OL,12,FThe local authority said it had
OL,13,Freceived national recognition for its
OL,14,Fwork with the young people, many of
OL,15,Fthem fleeing war or persecution.
OL,17,FBut it said the rise in numbers would
OL,18,Fbe challenging due to a lack of housing
OL,19,Fin its area, adding that the algorithm
OL,20,Fdid not take into account the local
OL,21,Fsituation.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
