OL,3,GNEWSAAlgorithm allocates Highland
OL,4,A'significant increase' in
OL,5,Aasylum-seeking children
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Home Office said councils had a
OL,8,Fstatutory duty to support children
OL,9,Farriving in the UK without a parent or
OL,10,Fguardian, and it was committed to
OL,11,Fworking closely with authorities to
OL,12,Fhelp them meet their obligations.
